---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section id="how" class="mt-24 md:mt-32 scroll-mt-24">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-400 uppercase">Built to respect your audience</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight">
        It knows when to step back.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600">
        Once someone has supported you, QuietJar quietly leaves them alone for
        a while. It does not nag the people who already gave. Your biggest
        supporters get thanked, not pestered. That is what keeps them coming
        back.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex gap-3 items-center">
        <div class="bg-black rounded-full p-2 w-9 h-9 shrink-0"><Icon class="text-white" name="bx:bxs-heart" /></div>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Your fans get thanked for giving, never chased for giving again.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">What it feels like to your most loyal supporter</p>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Supports you once</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-green-300 bg-green-50 px-4 py-3 text-green-700">A quiet "thank you"</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-slate-500">QuietJar steps back and stops asking</div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 text-slate-600">Comes back later to support you again</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
